          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.52,
          "end": 49.5,
          "en": "learn more about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.5,
          "end": 51.92,
          "en": "But again, you can also use the official docs here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.92,
          "end": 54.74,
          "en": "to learn how redux and redux toolkit works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.74,
          "end": 57.033,
          "en": "That is absolutely fine as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.01,
          "end": 61.32,
          "en": "Now we will be using this package in this section here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.32,
          "end": 64.97,
          "en": "and they offer the first thing which we have to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.97,
          "end": 67.73,
          "en": "which is of course also mentioned in the docs here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.73,
          "end": 71,
          "en": "If you dive into the quick start tutorial is to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71,
