          "en": "install redux toolkit and react redux.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.42,
          "end": 79.15,
          "en": "So we copy that and install this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.15,
          "end": 84.15,
          "en": "with npminstall@reduxjs/toolkit and react-redux.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.93,
          "end": 88.78,
          "en": "With that installed, we can use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.78,
          "end": 90.849,
          "en": "And now to use redux here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.849,
          "end": 94.67,
          "en": "I will go into this redux folder in the store folder.",
