        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.81,
          "end": 121.71,
          "en": "For this, we import something from @reduxjs/toolkit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.71,
          "end": 125.793,
          "en": "and that something is a configured store function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.09,
          "end": 128.27,
          "en": "We can then create a store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.27,
          "end": 130.48,
          "en": "by calling configure store like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.41,
          "end": 134.34,
          "en": "and to configure store we pass an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.34,
          "end": 136.52,
          "en": "where we add a reducer key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.52,
          "end": 139.273,
          "en": "which holds an empty object as a value for the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.17000000000002,
          "end": 145.17000000000002,
          "en": "Reducers are the different slices of state, so of data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.5,
          "end": 149.15,
          "en": "and actions that can change that data that are used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.15,
          "end": 151.93,
          "en": "by redux to then construct an overall store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.93,
          "end": 154.32,
          "en": "of data and actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.32,
          "end": 156.43,
          "en": "But again, if you wanna learn all about redux",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.43,
          "end": 158.63,
          "en": "definitely take a look at the official docs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.72,
          "end": 164.14,
          "en": "Then we export this store here and now as a next step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.14,
          "end": 168.69,
          "en": "just as with the context, we have to provide it to this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.69,
          "end": 170.12,
          "en": "So just as with context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.12,
          "end": 173.99,
          "en": "we should wrap our redux provider and our store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.99,
          "end": 176.76,
          "en": "around all the components that need to interact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.76,
          "end": 178.49,
          "en": "with the redux store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.49,
          "end": 179.64,
          "en": "And therefore here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.64,
          "end": 182.66,
          "en": "since I have totally different components in different parts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.66,
          "end": 187.29,
          "en": "of the app, I will wrap redux around my component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.29,
          "end": 189.2,
          "en": "a tree here in the same place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.2,
          "end": 192.07,
          "en": "as I wrap my context provider.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.07,
          "end": 194.64,
          "en": "I will just comment out the context provider now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.64,
          "end": 198.81,
          "en": "and instead use just provider opening.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 198.81,
          "end": 203.163,
          "en": "And then after the navigation container, closing tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.7,
          "end": 207.61,
          "en": "Now provider this component we're using here",
