          "end": 220.53300000000002,
          "en": "So not from redux toolkit, but from react redux.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.61,
          "end": 224.683,
          "en": "Now to this provider, you need to pass your store.",
